#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:26
#: ddf93d735b0e4156b08cd9190a869442
msgid ""
"The results control: pills reading NPV, delta, gamma, vega, theta per "
"day, elasticity, ITM cash probability and rho, under a description saying"
" an engine that cannot supply one is a named rejection rather than a "
"missing key, and a checkbox below for the engine's own additional "
"results."
msgstr ""
"results 控制項：一排藥丸標籤，寫著 NPV、delta、gamma、vega、theta per day、elasticity、ITM "
"cash probability 與 "
"rho；下面一行說明寫著「引擎無法提供的那一個會是具名的拒絕，而不是少掉的鍵」，再下面是一個「把引擎自己的額外結果也要進來」的核取方塊。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:30
#: 4560a95a1de54f8fba5eedd8ed417120
msgid ""
"Asked for by name, one pill each; the NPV comes whether or not it is "
"there. The line under the control is the promise the next section is "
"about, and the checkbox at the foot is what adds the engine's own extras."
msgstr ""
"全部按名字點，一個一個藥丸；NPV "
"則不管有沒有點都會回來。控制項下面那行字就是下一節要講的承諾，而最下面那個核取方塊，是把引擎自己的額外結果一起要進來的開關。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:35
#: d00454f5c2f84e31a253a7efaff7824c
msgid "\"Not supplied\" is not zero"
msgstr "「未提供」不等於零"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:37
#: d8625f3a37484d448fe3f5fb635b7942
msgid ""
"Engines publish different things. QuantLib's analytic European engine has"
" a vega; the binomial engine does not; the American approximations "
"publish almost no greeks at all. Asked for something it cannot supply, "
"the service **names the absence**: the kind comes back in a list of "
"unavailable results and the price comes back with it."
msgstr ""
"不同引擎發布的東西不同。QuantLib 的歐式解析解引擎有 "
"vega；二元樹引擎沒有；美式近似法幾乎不發布任何希臘字母。當被索取它無法提供的東西時，服務會**指名這個缺席**：該種類會出現在「無法提供的結果」清單中，而價格照樣回來。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:43
#: 9d19f52a018641b3b236c64a30935860
msgid ""
"This matters because a client that asked for vega and got a map without "
"it cannot tell that from a vega of zero. The results grid reads \"not "
"supplied\" on that row. Refusing the whole request instead would cost the"
" price as well — which is why the service does not do it."
msgstr ""
"這件事很重要，因為索取 vega 卻拿到一張沒有 vega 的對照表的用戶端，無法把它和「vega "
"等於零」區分開來。結果表格在那一列顯示「未提供」。若改成拒絕整個請求，連價格也會一起賠掉——這正是服務不那樣做的原因。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:48
#: 5a515f5019a748bf90699e8c9189b387
msgid ""
"The result pane after a lattice price: NPV 9.287603, delta and gamma with"
" numbers, then VEGA, THETA_PER_DAY, ELASTICITY, ITM_CASH_PROBABILITY and "
"RHO each reading \"not supplied\" in amber, above an engine line reading "
"lattice, cox ross rubinstein, 200 steps."
msgstr ""
"用格點法定價之後的結果面板：NPV 是 9.287603，delta 與 gamma 都有數字，接著 "
"VEGA、THETA_PER_DAY、ELASTICITY、ITM_CASH_PROBABILITY 與 RHO 各自以琥珀色寫著「not "
"supplied」，下面一行引擎資訊寫著 lattice、cox ross rubinstein、200 steps。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:52
#: 44246899c66e4b65ad683900e3b2501d
msgid ""
"Eight kinds asked of a Cox-Ross-Rubinstein lattice. Delta and gamma the "
"tree publishes; the other five it does not, and each one is named rather "
"than dropped. The price came back all the same, which is the whole design"
" of this list."
msgstr ""
"向一棵 Cox-Ross-Rubinstein 樹要了八種結果。delta 與 gamma "
"這棵樹有發佈；另外五種它沒有，而每一種都是被具名回報，不是被默默丟掉。價格照樣回來了——這正是這份清單存在的用意。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:58
#: 3adffd5472014a269c49d83bbf60b829
msgid ""
"The same list carries a kind that does not apply to the instrument at "
"all: a fair rate asked of an option, a greek asked of a swap."
msgstr "同一份清單也會裝進根本不適用於該商品的種類：向選擇權索取公平利率，或向利率交換索取希臘字母。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:61
#: f409f73d68ff4464b51391f10e68b841
msgid ""
"And it carries one case that is not about what the engine publishes but "
"about what it publishes *badly*. Both cliquet closed forms set gamma to a"
" literal `0.0` rather than computing it — and the performance one does "
"the same to delta — which would arrive here as a number rather than as an"
" absence. Those kinds are named absent for the cliquet instead, because a"
" zero nobody computed is the one answer this list exists to prevent."
msgstr ""
"這份清單還帶著一個案例，重點不在引擎發布了什麼，而在它發布得*不對*。兩個棘輪式解析解引擎都把 gamma 設成一個字面上的 "
"`0.0`，而不是真的去算——表現型引擎對 delta "
"也是這樣——這樣它到這裡會變成一個數字，而不是一個「沒有」。所以棘輪式的這些種類會被改列為具名缺席：一個沒有人算過的零，正是這份清單存在的目的所要避免的答案。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:68
#: b4c0606c42864facb04941df4fa375b2
msgid ""
"A **basket** puts five kinds on the list at once, and for a plainer "
"reason: a multi-asset option in QuantLib does not declare them. Theta per"
" day, delta forward, elasticity, strike sensitivity and ITM cash "
"probability all belong to the single-asset instrument; a basket stops at "
"delta, gamma, theta, vega, rho and dividend rho. Ask for one of the five "
"and it comes back named absent, the same as any other greek an engine "
"does not publish."
msgstr ""
"**一籃子**一次就把五個種類放上這份清單，理由則單純得多：QuantLib 的多標的選擇權根本沒有宣告它們。每日 theta、遠期 "
"delta、彈性、履約價敏感度與價內現金機率全都屬於單標的商品；一籃子只到 delta、gamma、theta、vega、rho 與股利 rho "
"為止。要這五個裡的任何一個，回來的都是具名的「沒有」，和任何其他引擎不發布的希臘字母一樣。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:75
#: 0420235489a44396be3d74a1a6b71773
msgid "Implied volatility"
msgstr "隱含波動率"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:77
#: 3abe2ef745d342d09fb09bf4791ea092
msgid ""
"This is the one result that takes an input of its own. It is a root find,"
" not a published quantity, so the request must carry **the price to "
"invert** and, optionally, the bracket and tolerance to search in. Left "
"empty, the request is refused rather than answered — inverting the price "
"the request is about to compute would hand back the volatility you sent."
msgstr "這是唯一一個自帶輸入的結果。它是一次求根，不是被發布的量，因此請求必須帶上**要反推的價格**，並可選擇性地帶上搜尋區間與容忍度。留空的話，請求會被拒絕而不是被回答——反推這個請求即將算出的價格，只會把你送來的波動率原封奉還。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:83
#: f327b88966814f6b8e51cee55b67484d
msgid ""
"The **From Last Price** button fills in the NPV that came back last, "
"which is the usual question: what volatility does *this* price imply."
msgstr "**From Last Price** 按鈕會填入上一次回來的淨現值，那也是通常的問題：*這個*價格隱含的是什麼波動率。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:86
#: 456f50be157549898388913ab8128985
msgid ""
"The implied volatility card: a target price of 12.459717 with a \"From "
"Last Price\" button beside it, and accuracy, min volatility and max "
"volatility all zero, each noting that zero leaves QuantLib's own."
msgstr ""
"隱含波動率卡片：target price 是 12.459717，旁邊有一個「From Last Price」按鈕；accuracy、min "
"volatility 與 max volatility 都是 0，每個下面都註明 0 表示沿用 QuantLib 自己的預設。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:90
#: bc9e34ca347c47cb803791bb5393495d
msgid ""
"The card appears only when the kind is asked for, because it is the only "
"request that carries an input of its own. **From Last Price** has just "
"filled the target with the NPV that came back a moment ago; the three "
"search fields left at zero leave QuantLib's own defaults in place."
msgstr ""
"只有在點了這一種結果時卡片才會出現，因為它是唯一一個自己帶輸入的請求。**From Last Price** 剛剛把上一次回來的 NPV "
"填進了目標價；三個搜尋欄位留成 0，就是沿用 QuantLib 自己的預設。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:96
#: 7abd202fa3434b278f6132d8d727ec1e
msgid ""
"QuantLib can invert a vanilla, a barrier and a double barrier. Asked of "
"any other style, the kind comes back named absent like any other "
"unsupplied result."
msgstr "QuantLib 能反推一般型、障礙與雙障礙。若向其他類型索取，該種類會像任何其他未提供的結果那樣，被指名為缺席。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:99
#: 47ccb1f618b74aeb8ded754b34619510
msgid "Additional results"
msgstr "額外結果"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:101
#: ff5494afdf124608bd41abf51f1dcae1
msgid ""
"Ask for them and the engine's own published extras come back as well. "
"Every value at this layer is a **scalar** — the vector and matrix forms "
"are not filled — and the Monte Carlo error estimate is populated whenever"
" the engine has one."
msgstr "索取它們，引擎自己發布的附加項目也會一併回來。這一層的每個值都是**純量**——向量與矩陣形式不會被填入——而只要引擎有誤差估計，蒙地卡羅的誤差估計就會被填入。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:106
#: d82d4caf2d7e468c9ee338c1ea56545a
msgid "Cash flows"
msgstr "現金流"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:108
#: 82e9894230e448259d9aad14d96f8a64
msgid ""
"Served for cash-flow instruments, which today means swaps. Each row "
"carries its payment date, the amount, the discount factor the engine "
"used, and their product, so **the present-value column sums to the NPV**."
" That property is what makes the table worth showing rather than "
"decorating, and the service's own smoke test checks it."
msgstr "提供給有現金流的商品，目前指的就是利率交換。每一列帶著付款日、金額、引擎所用的折現因子，以及兩者的乘積，因此**現值欄的總和就是淨現值**。正是這個性質讓這張表值得展示而不只是裝飾，而服務自己的煙霧測試會檢查它。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:114
#: 2b8e119c6971485d81035447d39a0aea
msgid ""
"Coupons add their accrual dates, notional and rate; floating coupons add "
"the fixing date, the spread and the gearing, and say whether the fixing "
"came from the fixing history or is still a forecast. Rows already paid "
"are left out."
msgstr "票息會補上計息起訖日、名目本金與利率；浮動票息再補上定盤日、利差與槓桿倍數，並說明該定盤值是取自歷史定盤，還是仍為預測值。已支付的列不列出。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:118
#: 133ba76e07924ad2bf1bde5cf27d03e7
msgid ""
"The cash-flow table for the five-year swap: columns for leg, payment "
"date, notional, rate, fixing, amount, discount and present value. The "
"fixed leg's rows carry 2.7000 per cent and no fixing; the floating rows "
"carry a rate and a fixing-date badge, the first highlighted in green and "
"the second in grey."
msgstr ""
"五年期交換合約的現金流表：欄位有 leg、付款日、名目本金、利率、fixing、金額、折現因子與現值。固定端的每一列都是 2.7000 %、沒有 "
"fixing；浮動端的列則帶著利率與一個定盤日的標籤，第一個是綠色、第二個是灰色。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:122
#: c98f805ff3874bd0afd515748a55c1ba
msgid ""
"Both legs in one table, and the present-value column adds up to the NPV. "
"The badge in the fixing column is the distinction that matters when a leg"
" is mid period: green for a fixing taken from the history you supplied, "
"grey for one the curve is still forecasting."
msgstr ""
"兩條腿放在同一張表裡，而現值那一欄加起來就是 NPV。fixing "
"欄位裡的標籤，是一條腿處在計息期間中途時真正重要的區別：綠色表示這個定盤值來自你提供的歷史，灰色表示曲線還在預測它。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:128
#: aa7db4c447894ba5a4654f1a0bd20bb3
msgid ""
"Asked of an option it is refused: an empty table would read as an "
"instrument that happens to have no cash flows rather than one that was "
"never going to have any."
msgstr "向選擇權索取它會被拒絕：一張空表讀起來像是「這個商品剛好沒有現金流」，而不是「它本來就不會有」。"

