"Bootstrapped curve, five years across sixty points, and a chart titled "
"BC.discountFactor against years falling from 1 to about 0.87."
msgstr ""
"曲線面板：quantity 選 discount factor、curve 選 BC — Bootstrapped "
"curve、五年、六十個點，圖表標題是 BC.discountFactor against years，曲線從 1 一路降到大約 0.87。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:155
#: 054e27002538497f9307a4eb1a6842a9
msgid ""
"Sixty points off the bootstrapped curve, which come back with the next "
"price rather than from anything rebuilt on this side. A discount factor "
"needs no compounding or frequency, so the panel does not ask for any — "
"pick a zero rate instead and it does."
msgstr "從自助拔靴曲線上取的六十個點，它們跟著下一次定價一起回來，而不是由這一側重建出來的。折現因子不需要複利方式與頻率，所以面板也不會問——改選零息利率，它就會問。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:161
#: caea4a510de9431eaa363dc506f5a808
msgid "The engine echo, and the pin"
msgstr "引擎回音與釘選"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:163
#: 162149f93b79456988a77f89ca0f14b1
msgid ""
"Every result carries the engine **as it ran**. Pin one and every later "
"price shows a Δ against it, engine echo included, so a comparison always "
"says what it is comparing. Differences are marked with ▲ and ▼ as well as"
" colour."
msgstr ""
"每個結果都帶著**實際執行**的引擎。釘選一個之後，之後每次計價都顯示對它的差額 "
"Δ，連引擎回音一起，因此比較永遠說得出自己在比什麼。差異除了顏色之外，也以 ▲ 與 ▼ 標示。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:167
#: bd195df657e84d078be877265172238b
msgid ""
"The result pane with a baseline pinned: NPV 16.030340 with a green up-"
"triangle and 6.732864 beside it, delta, gamma and vega each with their "
"own signed difference, an engine line reading analytic, and a final line "
"reading against baseline 9.297476, analytic."
msgstr ""
"釘住基準之後的結果面板：NPV 是 16.030340，旁邊有一個綠色向上三角形與 6.732864；delta、gamma 與 vega "
"各自帶著自己的差額；引擎那行寫著 analytic；最後一行寫著 against baseline 9.297476、analytic。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/results.md:171
#: 2dc9b9a756354c698b088213a691c281
msgid ""
"The same trade after the spot moved, against a pinned baseline. Every row"
" carries its own difference, and the last line names what is being "
"compared: the baseline's price *and* the engine that produced it, so a "
"comparison across two engines can never be mistaken for one across two "
"markets."
msgstr "同一筆交易，在現貨移動之後，與釘住的基準相比。每一列都帶著自己的差額，而最後一行寫明了被比較的是什麼：基準的價格*以及*算出它的那個引擎——所以跨兩個引擎的比較，永遠不會被誤認成跨兩個市場的比較。"

